sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant API as Backend API
    participant APP as Application Service
    participant RT as Agent Runtime
    participant MG as Model Gateway
    participant TG as Tool Gateway
    participant OBS as Observability

    U->>API: POST /support/assist
    API->>API: auth + validate + rate limit
    API->>APP: execute use case
    APP->>RT: run agent with bounded context
    RT->>MG: model request
    MG-->>RT: structured model response
    RT->>TG: optional tool call
    TG-->>RT: tool result or approval required
    RT->>OBS: trace spans + metrics
    RT-->>APP: AgentResult
    APP-->>API: Product response
    API-->>U: JSON response
